&lt;div class=&quot;gwt-HTML&quot;&gt;As a business leader, the Director Logistics Security &amp;amp; Loss Prevention will build and implement solutions for a variety of unique security challenges from physical security of sites, to theft and fraud, and to formulating response to critical incidents affecting Coupang Last Mile. You will obsess over maximizing the employee and customer experience, and drive a global strategy that sets the bar for Coupang and the security team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gwt-HTML&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;WMSF WMRF WOSF&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;039fa9c4027d4900abb56761d53fbcb0&quot; class=&quot;WATF&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;decorationWrapper&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;WASI WCRI WBSI&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;039fa9c4027d4900abb56761d53fbcb0-2897ec760af032a2&quot; data-automation-widget=&quot;richTextArea&quot; data-automation-metadata-id=&quot;56$309310&quot; data-uxi-form-item-child-list-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-v47zm2-FocusContainer e1ge5hpl0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1mb50em-EditorContainer e1ge5hpl1&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;richTextEditor&quot; data-metadata-id=&quot;56$309310&quot; data-uxi-widget-editable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1v6ili8-TextEditorContainer eg1t6ed0&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;richTextContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ehfww1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ProseMirror&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Lead&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Logistics Security&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Loss Prevention&amp;nbsp;team in developing and implementing business strategy and security processes throughout the organization to reduce risks, respond to incidents, and limit exposure and liability&amp;nbsp;concerning&amp;nbsp;financial, physical, personal, and reputational risk.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Provide&amp;nbsp;guidance and&amp;nbsp;mentorship to our&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;team on safe guarding assets, operations, technology, and practices to anticipate, address, prevent, and mitigate security and loss issues across&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;supply chain.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Lead deployment of groundbreaking technology solutions and innovative Loss Prevention management techniques to safeguard&amp;nbsp;Coupang’s&amp;nbsp;assets, employees and customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Provide leadership and support to&amp;nbsp;operations&amp;nbsp;teams in emergency situations like natural disasters and active threats&amp;nbsp;that disrupt business operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Assess and analyze safety, theft, and loss risk to&amp;nbsp;Coupang&amp;nbsp;and realign Loss Prevention strategy,&amp;nbsp;as appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

