&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Threat Researcher to join our Zscaler Threat Hunting team, reporting to the Senior Manager, Zscaler Threat Hunting at Pune Office. You will analyze emerging threats, adversarial behaviors, and TTPs to understand attacker methodologies and improve detection capabilities across our global ecosystem. This role requires conducting proactive and retroactive threat hunting using Zscaler telemetry, independently responding to customers, and working flexible schedules—including weekend night shifts—to meet operational demands and ensure comprehensive security coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
