&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Analyze emerging threats, adversarial behaviors, and TTPs to enhance detection capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;Conduct proactive and retroactive threat hunting using Zscaler telemetry and behavioral-based methodologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;Research, analyze, validate, and document threat hunting findings with high precision&lt;/p&gt;
