&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,4,0&quot;&gt;Identify detection gaps and collaborate with the broader team to improve overall security posture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
