&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Extensive experience in threat hunting, incident response, security operations, malware analysis, or network defense&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on expertise in SIEM tools such as Splunk, Microsoft Sentinel, or ElasticSearch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;Deep familiarity with the MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK framework and modern adversary TTPs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s or graduate degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related discipline, or equivalent security industry experience&lt;/p&gt;
