&lt;li&gt;A variety of schedules to fit your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship programs &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple employee recognition programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 / 7 on call clinical manager support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health benefits (full-time and part-time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive and stable work environment and the tools you need to do your job. We invest in our nursing team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
