&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Hospice is looking for Volunteers in Delaware County!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an unpaid position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Hospice of Media, PA is looking for volunteers to join our team!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Hospice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; has a special purpose - to help people with advanced illness and at end-of-life have comfort, grace, and dignity. We believe families deserve hospice care delivered with compassion, excellence and reliability - our core values. Our caring and professional team members at Bayada Hospice are passionate about providing quality hospice services that can make a difference in patients&#39; and caregivers&#39; lives. We serve the counties of Chester, Delaware and Philadelphia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Volunteer opportunities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making tuck-in calls to our families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping with bereavement follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office administration tasks such as putting together informational packets or supplies for patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**If there&#39;s something you&#39;d like to do with us that you don&#39;t see listed? Just ask! We try to be as flexible as possible with our volunteers and are always happy to make individualized experiences available so that you have a volunteering experience that is both empowering and rewarding!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the benefits of volunteering with BAYADA Hospice? Become involved in your community, make a difference in the lives of others, be part of a caring and compassionate team of hospice professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact Volunteer Coordinator,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Suzanne Pepe @ 267-638-1483 or spepe@bayada.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, write, and effectively communicate in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a criminal background check completed, as per state requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet all state requirements for volunteers, where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet the BAYADA requirements and state regulations for the discipline, if providing professional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA believes that our clients and their families deserve home health care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
