&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Guidde is an AI digital adoption platform that serves as the creation and consumption hub for modern organizations. Founded in 2020 by seasoned entrepreneurs, we use generative AI to transform workflows into rich, multi-format documentation in minutes. Our platform helps teams scale knowledge across employees, customers, and even AI systems, turning everyday processes into instant, in-app video guiddes that live where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;More than 4,500 organizations worldwide, from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 enterprises, rely on Guidde to reduce support load, accelerate onboarding, and make knowledge accessible on demand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building the future of how knowledge is created, shared, and experienced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;The Ideal &quot;Guidder&quot; is like our platform - clear, impactful, and focused on delivering value. We blend a startup environment with sports team principles - strategic in planning, collaborative in execution, and obsessed with customer wins. We value doers who listen more than they talk and who show up ready to play their best game. Ready to make your mark on our roster? Go Guidde!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;If you are someone who gets energized by building workplaces where people feel genuinely valued, thrives on juggling strategic culture-building with the hands-on work that makes everything run smoothly, and wants to be a founding force shaping people experience across a global team, then your place is with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will your day-to-day look?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead EMEA people experience and workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - own the end-to-end employee experience and workplace operations for our Israel office and remote EMEA team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion exceptional employee programs&lt;/strong&gt; - design and drive recognition and engagement initiatives from planning to execution that make Guidde a place where people thrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage people operations&lt;/strong&gt; - oversee projects, benefits, and build scalable processes that empower teams and keep information accessible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the face and heartbeat of our Israel office&lt;/strong&gt; - manage day-to-day workplace operations, vendor relationships, and foster an environment where productivity and connection thrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the EMEA people experience budget&lt;/strong&gt; - handle annual financial planning, monitor expenditure, and maximize impact across workplace and people initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner as a founding global HR team member&lt;/strong&gt; - collaborate to build cohesive people practices and create an exceptional Guidder culture worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-5 years in people operations or workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - preferably in high-growth startup environments where you&#39;ve worn multiple hats and owned outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;True all-arounder with a doer mindset&lt;/strong&gt; - equally comfortable planning a big culture event, designing engagement programs, and partnering with leadership on strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget and vendor management experience&lt;/strong&gt; - proven ability to manage spend, track expenses, and negotiate with vendors while maximizing ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt; - ability to juggle multiple priorities, anticipate needs, and proactively solve problems before they escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder mentality&lt;/strong&gt; - experience creating scalable people operations workflows and continuously optimizing the employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Based in Israel with hybrid availability&lt;/strong&gt; - ability to be in our Israel office 3 days per week as an active presence for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with global, distributed teams across time zones and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;An adaptable, nimble approach - skilled at building for scale while flexing with evolving business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Curiosity about new tools and approaches that make work better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your journey with Guidde&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leave Your Mark:&lt;/strong&gt; Join the founding global HR team and lead people experience and workplace for EMEA as we build one of the most exceptional cultures in SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Your Way (Hybrid):&lt;/strong&gt; Flexible arrangement with 3 days per week in our Israel office, collaborating with our US-based team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the EMEA executive team and US HR colleagues to shape how we support, grow, and celebrate our people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel Your Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and expand your impact across broader people and culture initiatives as we scale globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Value Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a competitive compensation and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We hire talented and passionate people from a variety of backgrounds because we want our global employee base to represent the wide diversity of our customers. If you&#39;re excited about a role but your past experience doesn&#39;t align perfectly with every bullet point listed in the job description, we still encourage you to apply. If you&#39;re a builder at heart, share our company values, and are enthusiastic about making software toolmaking ubiquitous, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

